  "prefLabel": "Ncr 735.02 Trail Use Limitations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 735.02 Trail Use Limitations. No person shall use the following equipment or animals on the Franconia Notch recreational trail:\n\n(a) Skateboards;\n\n(b) Roller skates, rollerblades, or roller skis;\n\n(c) Children’s tricycles, except these shall be permitted from the parking lot to the Old Man Viewing Area;\n\n(d) Motorized bicycles;\n\n(e) Electronic Personal Assistive Mobility Devices (EPAMD), such as Segways; or\n\n(f) Horses.\n\nSource. #14055 EMERGENCY, EXPIRED: 2-15-25\n\nNew. #14291, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr700.html"
